            {
                "entry_id": "b3bcef5c-e4fa-3b51-b7e3-b18e5352c91f",
                "word": "supergirl",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "da5092a4-6d84-4a23-b7b6-9ac4e2a31faa",
                        "entry_id": "b3bcef5c-e4fa-3b51-b7e3-b18e5352c91f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "supergirls"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0736d7cf-7ae0-39e9-9dd9-bc5727300cf9",
                        "entry_id": "b3bcef5c-e4fa-3b51-b7e3-b18e5352c91f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A girl who is particularly successful, talented, or otherwise remarkable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "88d2d408-dabb-4f06-80be-4d5f020b8c88",
                                "sense_id": "0736d7cf-7ae0-39e9-9dd9-bc5727300cf9",
                                "text": "\"A soda,\" Toria suggested. \"Could I also have quarters for the video game?\" Anya countered. \"Okay, okay, but only if it's all right with your dad.\" Anya jumped up and down, tugging on Toria with supergirl strength. Nick put his hands on his hips."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2c0894bb-1ac9-4d26-9d76-259dfcdbd59c",
                                "sense_id": "0736d7cf-7ae0-39e9-9dd9-bc5727300cf9",
                                "text": "[…] garrulous skull paperweight wresting the spotlight away from Ruby-Spears' flying cars, supergirls and sasquatches."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "476f0816-2139-4330-8b12-277c5d8fb4db",
                                "sense_id": "0736d7cf-7ae0-39e9-9dd9-bc5727300cf9",
                                "text": "And it ignores the privilege that helps only certain girls become supergirls and makes them suffer when they come close to achieving this status […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b4fbb6db-4ce2-4ede-848f-b864f5737d28",
                                "sense_id": "0736d7cf-7ae0-39e9-9dd9-bc5727300cf9",
                                "text": "An average Chinese girl, with talent in singing, dancing, or acting, can be elected a supergirl by TV media outlets."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1e9fe900-c528-4a6e-9aa8-02c43877c84b",
                                "sense_id": "0736d7cf-7ae0-39e9-9dd9-bc5727300cf9",
                                "text": "You may be a supergirl on the go, but that doesn't mean you can't figure out ways to maximize your morning minutes with some simple nutrition."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fdfbac6d-1675-4d26-b80b-e836a8ec957f",
                                "sense_id": "0736d7cf-7ae0-39e9-9dd9-bc5727300cf9",
                                "text": "[…] emphasis on perfection, resulting in mounting pressure on girls to be supergirls."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
